			"size": [
				450.0,
				180.0
			],
			"text": "07 — Physics: Joints, Soft Body & Area\n\nHingeJoint constrains a rigid pendulum to a static anchor.\nSoftBodyCOMP drapes a cloth-like grid under gravity.\nAreaCOMP applies a sideways wind force field.\n\nDemonstrates JointCOMP, SoftBodyCOMP, AreaCOMP,\nand the full SOP+MAT → COMP → Merge → Render pipeline.",
			"type": "note"
		}
	],
